# Undersea Scouting (ToAU 9, mission.toau.undersea_scouting). A level 75 Warrior of Bastok with it current, in Aht
# Urhgan Whitegate: Naja 3051, the Option var cycling 1, 0, 1 (the dialog operand). Alzadaal Undersea Ruins: trigger
# area 23 (394 -1 -619 .. 487 1 -540): 1 (the mercenary rank, 0), finished: completed, the Astral Compass, Astral
# Waves current.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/onTriggerAreaEnter/23 AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/onEventFinish/1
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=40,-6,-30 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Toau UnderseaScouting current
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # Option 0: dialog 1
finish
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # dialog 0
finish
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # dialog 1
finish
warp 400,0,-500 AlzadaalUnderseaRuins
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
walk 420,0,-580                         # area 23: 1
finish                                  # completed
